    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_sp01_00",
      "hash64": "F68097F619D1735F",
      "text": "Oh... Conque eres tú.[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_sp01_01",
      "hash64": "F68096F619D171AC",
      "text": "¿Así que ahora te dedicas a movilizar personal\\na otras regiones?\\c\\nQué confianza para ser tan joven... Me recuerdas\\na alguien que yo me sé.[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 64,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 140,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_sp01_02",
      "hash64": "F68099F619D176C5",
      "text": "Pero no me quejo. En el fondo, suelo disfrutar\\ncon los viajes de negocios.[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 74,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_sp01_03",
      "hash64": "F68098F619D17512",
      "text": "Me permiten dedicar tiempo a otras aficiones\\naparte del trabajo.[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 64,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_sp01_04",
      "hash64": "F68093F619D16C93",
      "text": "Los platos típicos de la gastronomía de Teselia\\nson el Sándwich Villa y los Porcehelados.\\c\\n¿Cuál me recomendarías tú?[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 119,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_sp01_select_01",
      "hash64": "508901898B20563B",
      "text": "El Sándwich Villa",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_sp01_select_02",
      "hash64": "508902898B2057EE",
      "text": "Los Porcehelados",
      "flags": 0,
