      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_sp01_05",
      "hash64": "F68092F619D16AE0",
      "text": "Ya veo. Así que eres más de bocadillos.[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_sp01_05b",
      "hash64": "ADE43A2DDED7FAE6",
      "text": "Ya veo. Así que eres más de dulces.[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 35,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_sp01_06",
      "hash64": "F68095F619D16FF9",
      "text": "Tomo debida nota.[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_sp01_07",
      "hash64": "F68094F619D16E46",
      "text": "Cuando termine de dar la charla, iré a por uno.[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 47,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_sp02_00",
      "hash64": "CA798DEFB8675DB0",
      "text": "Oh, tú otra vez.[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_sp02_01",
      "hash64": "CA798EEFB8675F63",
      "text": "Seguí tu consejo y fui a probar el Sándwich Villa.\\c\\nEs marcadamente distinto a los bocadillos que se\\nestilan en Paldea, pero está francamente rico.\\c\\nPregúntale si no a mi Staraptor, que lo picoteaba\\nsin cesar y con ansia inusitada.\\c\\nSupongo que el aroma de las bayas que emplean\\nen su elaboración le resultaba irresistible.[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 50,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 149,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 235,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 329,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_sp02_01b",
      "hash64": "73ECE25657A66EB3",
      "text": "Seguí tu consejo y fui a probar un Porcehelado.\\c\\nLa verdad, da gusto comerlo, con su equilibrio\\nentre textura cremosa y sabor intenso.\\c\\nPara mí, el helado salado de Nacli de Dulcinante\\nsigue sin tener rival, pero el Porcehelado queda\\r\\nen un más que digno segundo puesto.\\c\\nMérito sin duda de la cuidada selección de\\ningredientes naturales y locales.[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 47,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 136,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 237,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 276,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 356,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_sp02_02",
      "hash64": "CA798FEFB8676116",
      "text": "Vaya, hacía tiempo que no hablaba más de tres\\nfrases seguidas. Disculpa mi verborrea.[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_sp02_03",
      "hash64": "CA7990EFB86762C9",
      "text": "Para mí, lo más destacado de un viaje es siempre\\nla parte gastronómica.\\c\\nPodría disertar durante horas sobre mis hallazgos.[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 71,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 125,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_sp02_04",
      "hash64": "CA7991EFB867647C",
      "text": "Aunque tampoco negaré lo reconfortante que\\nresulta volver a casa y comer un onigiri de toda\\r\\nla vida, con su encanto hogareño.[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 128,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_sp03_00",
      "hash64": "F3B1A3E46DEA10C1",
      "text": "Una pregunta... ¿Tú has probado el comedor de\\nesta academia?[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 60,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_sp03_01",
      "hash64": "F3B1A2E46DEA0F0E",
      "text": "No está nada mal, ¿verdad?[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_sp03_01b",
      "hash64": "00E73626C4B83484",
      "text": "¿En serio? Pues no está nada mal.[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_sp03_02",
      "hash64": "F3B1A1E46DEA0D5B",
      "text": "Es obvio que está enfocado a una clientela joven.\\c\\nNo solo por el sabor intenso de los platos, sino\\nsobre todo por la generosidad de las raciones.[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 49,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 148,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_sp03_03",
      "hash64": "F3B1A0E46DEA0BA8",
      "text": "Uno de sus platos estrella me tiene maravillado:\\nlas superpatatas escolares.\\c\\nToda una montaña patatera que invita a una\\nexpedición culinaria y te incita a bailar.[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 76,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 165,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_sp03_04",
      "hash64": "F3B1A7E46DEA178D",
      "text": "Si aún no las has probado, te lo recomiendo\\nencarecidamente.[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 60,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_trade_01_00",
      "hash64": "23FC6E8CF2B8BFC3",
      "text": "Me sorprende la estoica atención que prestas a\\nmis desvaríos...[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 63,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_trade_01_01",
      "hash64": "23FC6D8CF2B8BE10",
      "text": "Realmente eres alguien fuera de lo normal.[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 42,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_trade_01_02",
      "hash64": "23FC708CF2B8C329",
      "text": "Tal vez tanto como para querer intercambiar\\nPokémon conmigo. ¿Qué me dices?[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 75,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_trade_01_03",
      "hash64": "23FC6F8CF2B8C176",
      "text": "Yo te ofrezco un Dudunsparce. No debería de\\ncostarte mucho igualar la oferta.[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_trade_01_04",
      "hash64": "23FC728CF2B8C68F",
      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)][VAR 0x0101(0001)] es un candidato prometedor,\\naparte de\\r\\nser el único que hay.\\c\\nGracias por el intercambio.[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
